  "body": "Property docs: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/BGKG\r\nAuction: Thursday, 26 Nov, from 12:00pm at Harcourts Takapuna (Unless Sold Prior)\r\n\r\nPrivately set back from the road on a 667sqm (more or less) freehold section, this spacious single-level home sits on one of Browns Bay's most sought-after streets, within the desirable Rangitoto College zone. Predominantly brick and tile, freshly painted inside and filled with natural light, it offers comfort, privacy and flexibility for family living.\r\n\r\nWith generous indoor and outdoor spaces, plus a large separate studio for added versatility, this home has plenty to offer. Presented to the market as a deceased estate, it's an exciting opportunity to secure a family home in a convenient Browns Bay location.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- 667sqm (more or less) freehold section with approx. 190sqm floor area\r\n- Predominantly brick and tile construction with easy single-level living\r\n- Four bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a master ensuite and walk-in wardrobe\r\n- Two bright living areas, one featuring sun tubes for extra natural light\r\n- Fireplace and central air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n- Large separate studio, ideal for a home office, creative space or home business\r\n- Sunny, private courtyard with plenty of space for children, outdoor activities and entertaining\r\n- Double garage with attic storage, plus two garden sheds\r\n- Ample off-street parking, with potential space for a boat or motorhome\r\n- Just a 4-minute walk to Bayside Reserve and its playground, and within walking distance of Browns Bay town centre\r\n- Zoned for Browns Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate and Rangitoto College\r\n\r\nWith clear motivation from the estate, this is a fantastic opportunity for families and investors alike to secure a versatile property with space, comfort and future potential. Get in touch today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nWe work with all agencies from Day 1.",
